WEBVTT

00:09:29.077 --> 00:09:31.000
social justice

00:09:31.024 --> 00:09:33.421
and the promotion of the common good.

00:09:34.302 --> 00:09:38.512
Many organizations,
Catholic and of other faiths,

00:09:38.536 --> 00:09:42.510
have already taken on the responsibility

00:09:42.534 --> 00:09:45.039
to act in this direction.

00:09:45.063 --> 00:09:48.598
In fact, the Earth must be
worked and nursed,

00:09:48.622 --> 00:09:51.443
cultivated and protected.

00:09:51.959 --> 00:09:58.286
We cannot continue
to squeeze it like an orange.

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:04.595
And we can say that this --
taking care of the Earth --